k City to earn the privilege of going on her nomad's journey. The very first step of that journey, however, may be closer to home than she realizes.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-07-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iCfQlnQ7ibSLJoW0piyWGtBhEan.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iCfQlnQ7ibSLJoW0piyWGtBhEan.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/214587/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"5473197","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With her first divinely appointed duty behind her, Belle waits impatiently for a second call to arms. She explores Park City in the meantime, until a chance meeting with the enigmatic solist Adonis piques her curiosity.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-08-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zsF1z8eURDhcjBbOVQBQ7NnVu71.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zsF1z8eURDhcjBbOVQBQ7NnVu71.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/214587/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"5473198","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Belle and Adonis march into the Katakombe in pursuit of the rebel solist Tiziano, only for their mismatched band to charge straight into a trap. Belle must make unlikely allies to avoid a watery grave.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-08-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rNgPsvDyAMmhVY4wPWzdSv5kKdm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rNgPsvDyAMmhVY4wPWzdSv5kKdm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/214587/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"5473199","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"ti